# flask_core.get_platform_version() reads flask_core/VERSION at runtime
# (see flask_core/platform_version.py). Every service Dockerfile does
# `COPY libs/flask_core ... && pip install .` -- the file must ship as
# installed package data, not just live in the source tree, so it is
# resolvable via Path(__file__).parent after installation into
# site-packages too.
include flask_core/VERSION
